  "body": "Closes #3223\n\n## Summary\n\nFire a fire-and-forget HEAD request early in startup to warm the TCP+TLS connection. Subsequent actual API calls reuse this connection, saving 100-200ms on the first request.\n\n**Smart skip conditions:**\n- Proxy env vars set (`HTTPS_PROXY`, `https_proxy`, `HTTP_PROXY`, `http_proxy`)\n- `NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS` set (enterprise TLS inspection)\n- Sandbox mode (process restarts, preconnect is ineffective)\n- Non-default `baseUrl` configured (mTLS / private deployment)\n\n**Controls:**\n- Disable via `QWEN_CODE_DISABLE_PRECONNECT=1`\n- Uses `AbortSignal.timeout(5s)` to bound resource lifetime\n\n## Changes in This PR\n\n- Add `https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com` to the preconnect whitelist so users on the DashScope openai-compatible API (`dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1`) benefit from preconnect instead of being silently skipped\n- Replace `benchmark-api-latency.sh` with `benchmark-api-latency.mjs`: uses undici directly (same library as preconnect) for accurate in-process connection reuse measurement, covers all 3 default endpoints, adds per-request timeout to avoid hanging on dashscope HEAD requests\n\n## Benchmark Results\n\nRun with `node scripts/benchmark-api-latency.mjs`:\n\n| Endpoint | Cold (avg) | Warm (avg) | Saved | Improvement |\n|----------|-----------|-----------|-------|-------------|\n| OpenAI | 755ms | 665ms | 90ms | 12% |\n| Anthropic | 622ms | 567ms | 55ms | 9% |\n| DashScope (openai-compatible) | 72ms | 55ms | 17ms | 24% |\n\n> Note: OpenAI/Anthropic show lower relative improvement because their high network RTT (~600ms) dwarfs the TCP+TLS savings (~90ms). The absolute savings are still meaningful.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] 19 unit tests covering all skip conditions, URL resolution, error handling\n- [x] Proxy / custom CA / sandbox / custom baseUrl skip scenarios\n- [x] Fire-once guarantee (no duplicate preconnects)\n- [x] DashScope compatible-mode URL triggers preconnect (new)\n- [x] DashScope subdomain-spoofed URL is rejected (new)\n- [x] `benchmark-api-latency.mjs` for accurate in-process measurement\n\n## Manual Verification\n\n> **说明：**\n> - 必须使用 `--prompt` 触发完整启动流程，`--version` 会被 yargs 提前拦截，preconnect 代码不会执行\n> - 日志写入文件而非终端，路径：`~/.qwen/debug/latest`，命令执行完毕后再 grep\n> - 日志时间戳为 UTC 时间\n\n### 场景 1：正常启动时预连接触发\n\n```bash\nnode packages/cli/dist/index.js --prompt \"hi\" --model qwen-plus\ngrep PRECONNECT ~/.qwen/debug/latest\n```\n\n预期日志：\n```\n[PRECONNECT] Preconnecting to: https://api.openai.com\n[PRECONNECT] Preconnect completed\n```\n<img width=\"1844\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ada2d80-df12-469c-a010-58fa8bcfc02f\" />\n<img width=\"889\" height=\"76\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e9c4918-77af-4cfc-aa49-a18dd231839c\" />\n\n---\n\n### 场景 2：`NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS` 设置时跳过\n\n```bash\nNODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS=/etc/ssl/cert.pem \\\n  node packages/cli/dist/index.js --prompt \"hi\" --model qwen-plus\ngrep PRECONNECT ~/.qwen/debug/latest\n```\n\n预期日志：\n```\n[PRECONNECT] Skipping preconnect: custom CA certificate configured\n```\n\n<img width=\"1734\" height=\"74\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aac123b4-6628-4cdf-b74b-3edc9f63f704\" />\n<img width=\"1020\" height=\"54\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1f62d33-e22c-4b22-af04-b2574849768b\" />\n\n---\n\n### 场景 3：`QWEN_CODE_DISABLE_PRECONNECT=1` 手动禁用\n\n```bash\nQWEN_CODE_DISABLE_PRECONNECT=1 \\\n  node packages/cli/dist/index.js --prompt \"hi\" --model qwen-plus\ngrep PRECONNECT ~/.qwen/debug/latest\n```\n\n预期日志：\n```\n[PRECONNECT] Preconnect disabled by environment variable\n```\n\n<img width=\"1601\" height=\"75\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fca6f098-41e3-478c-ac32-66542477841b\" />\n<img width=\"940\" height=\"66\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e23ca52f-d4a3-47e8-b550-4b0208affe3a\" />\n\n---\n\n### 场景 4：Sandbox 模式时跳过\n\n```bash\nSANDBOX=1 \\\n  node packages/cli/dist/index.js --prompt \"hi\" --model qwen-plus\ngrep PRECONNECT ~/.qwen/debug/latest\n```\n\n预期日志：\n```\n[PRECONNECT] Skipping preconnect: sandbox mode detected\n```\n\n<img width=\"1392\" height=\"74\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0fb7411-e3a3-4e2f-b292-85ec383237c7\" />\n<img width=\"918\" height=\"60\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7560c4dd-e19c-4445-aec9-6824c6804088\" />\n\n---\n\n### 场景 5：性能基准测试\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/benchmark-api-latency.mjs\n```\n\n<img width=\"946\" height=\"747\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea68effa-4743-40f9-8d1b-735a1b8a4a94\" />\n\n🤖 Generated with [Qwen Code](https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code)\n\n\n---\n\n> **📝 描述准确性更新（2026-05-31，作者自查）**\n>\n> 更正：配代理时并不跳过预连接，而是经共享 dispatcher 隧道复用（shouldSkipPreconnect 仅查 NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS）。\n",
